{"id":"e166b052d4d98d2a","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-shifting-lemma.md","title":"Shifting Lemma","display":"Shifting Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-shifting-lemma","aliases":["93-lem-shifting-lemma"],"display":"Shifting Lemma","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-modular]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-shifting-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-shifting-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Shifting Lemma"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" href=\"?note=c8ff2f79b6a4018b\" title=\"93-df-congruence-modular\">93-df-congruence-modular</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-shifting-lemma---Shifting-Lemma\">lem-shifting-lemma - Shifting Lemma</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\subseteq\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\subseteq\\gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\subseteq\\gamma\n\\to\\forall a,b,c,d\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(a\\,\\alpha\\,c\\land b\\,\\alpha\\,d\\land a\\,\\beta\\,b\\land c\\,\\beta\\,d\n\\to(a\\,\\gamma\\,b\\leftrightarrow c\\,\\gamma\\,d)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\subseteq\\gamma\n\\to\\forall a,b,c,d\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(a\\,\\alpha\\,c\\land b\\,\\alpha\\,d\\land a\\,\\beta\\,b\\land c\\,\\beta\\,d\n\\to(a\\,\\gamma\\,b\\leftrightarrow c\\,\\gamma\\,d)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The hypothesis is a congruence-modular variety, not merely the accidental modularity of the congruence lattice of one algebra; the uniform variety-level assumption supplies the shifting property.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-shifting-lemma---Shifting-Lemma","text":"lem-shifting-lemma - Shifting Lemma","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-modular","status":"resolved","id":"c8ff2f79b6a4018b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-modular]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\subseteq\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\n\\land\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\n\\land\\alpha\\cap\\beta\\subseteq\\gamma\n\\to\\forall a,b,c,d\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(a\\,\\alpha\\,c\\land b\\,\\alpha\\,d\\land a\\,\\beta\\,b\\land c\\,\\beta\\,d\n\\to(a\\,\\gamma\\,b\\leftrightarrow c\\,\\gamma\\,d)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1060,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","c8ff2f79b6a4018b"]}